					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="zh" dir="ltr"><table style="width:100%; margin-bottom:0px; border:1px solid #AADDAA; background-color: #E4F2E4; text-align:center;" class="ws-header">

<tbody><tr>
<td class="noprint" style="width:25%; text-align:left; font-size:small;">←<a href="/wiki/%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96/%E5%8D%B721" class="mw-redirect" title="戰國策/卷21">趙策四</a>
</td>
<td style="width:50%;"><b>戰國策卷二十二</b>　魏一<br /><span style="color:#999999">作者：</span><a href="/wiki/Author:%E5%8A%89%E5%90%91" title="Author:劉向">劉向</a>　<span style="color:#999999">西漢</span>
</td>
<td class="noprint" style="width:25%; text-align:right; font-size:small;"><a href="/wiki/%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96/%E5%8D%B723" class="mw-redirect" title="戰國策/卷23">魏策二</a>→
</td></tr></tbody></table>
